Sample library for demoloom's built-in music palettes (src/score/score.mjs).

Every file in this folder is CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication):
commercial use allowed, no attribution required.

Source: VCSL, the Versilian Community Sample Library, by Versilian Studios
        https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL
        LICENSE: CC0 1.0 Universal
        https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL/blob/master/LICENSE

Instrument   Files            VCSL folder
piano        piano_*.flac     Chordophones/Zithers/Grand Piano, Steinway B/Sus
vibes        vibes_*.flac     Idiophones/Struck Idiophones/Vibraphone/Soft Mallets

Each file was trimmed, converted to mono 44.1 kHz 16-bit FLAC, levelled and
renamed to its sounding pitch. index.json lists the original VCSL path of every
file.

Every other sound in the palettes (pads, plucks, bells, marimba, drums, clicks)
is synthesized in code at render time, so it carries the project's MIT licence.

Rule for this folder: CC0 only. Do not add anything CC BY, CC BY-NC, "free for
personal use" or of unclear origin.
